KJV renders: Hesed.

H2619.strongs:
Origin: from 2617 and 3050; Jah has favored;
Meaning: Chasadjah, an Israelite
KJV renders: Hasadiah.

H2621.strongs:
Origin: from 2620; hopeful;
Meaning: Chosah, an Israelite; also a place in Palestine
KJV renders: Hosah.

H2622.strongs:
Origin: from 2620;
Meaning: confidence
KJV renders: trust.

H2623.strongs:
Origin: from 2616;
