H2646.strongs:
Origin: from 2645;
Meaning: a canopy
KJV renders: chamber, closet, defence.

H2647.strongs:
Origin: the same as 2646;
Meaning: Chuppah, an Israelite
KJV renders: Huppah.

H2648.strongs:
Origin: a primitive root;
Meaning: properly, to start up suddenly, i.e. (by implication) to hasten away, to fear
KJV renders: (make) haste (away), tremble.

H2649.strongs:
Origin: from 2468;
Meaning: hasty flight
KJV renders: haste.

H2650.strongs:
Origin: plural of 2646 (compare 2349);
Meaning: Chuppim, an Israelite
KJV renders: Huppim.

H2651.strongs:
Origin: from an unused root of uncertain signification;
Meaning: a fist (only in the dual)
