H2740.strongs:
Origin: or (shortened) חָרֹן; from 2734;
Meaning: a burning of anger
KJV renders: sore displeasure, fierce(-ness), fury, (fierce) wrath(-ful).

H2741.strongs:
Origin: a patrial from (probably) a collateral form of 2756;
Meaning: a Charuphite or inhabitant of Charuph (or Chariph)
KJV renders: Haruphite.

H2742.strongs:
Origin: or חָרֻץ; passive participle of 2782;
