H2753.strongs:
Origin: or חוֹרִי; the same as 2752;
Meaning: Chori, the name of two men
KJV renders: Hori.

H2754.strongs:
Origin: or חָרִט; from the same as 2747;
Meaning: properly, cut out (or hollow), i.e. (by implication) a pocket
